  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a high-performing multimodal setup (scvi_n200 RNA + imagenet_vit_l image encoder with avgpool aggregation), achieving validation accuracy of 0.7062, slightly lower than the concat fusion baseline (0.7150). The result suggests weighted fusion may not improve performance compared to concat in this configuration. The effectiveness of fusion strategies and potential interactions with encoder choices remain uncertain without further comparative analysis."
